sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant IngestGW as Ingestion Gateway
    participant IngestCtrl as Ingest Controller
    participant MediaRepo as Media Repository
    participant JobRepo as IngestionJob Repository
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant StorageSvc as Storage Service
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO
    participant TranscribeSvc as Transcribe Service
    participant STTAPI as Whisper/Azure STT
    participant TranscriptRepo as Transcript Repository (PostgreSQL)
    participant DocStoreSvc as Document Store Service (MongoDB)
    participant EnrichSvc as Enrichment Service
    participant IndexerSvc as Indexer Service
    participant EmbeddingRepo as Embedding Repository (pgvector)
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    User->>IngestGW: POST /ingest/jobs<br/>{assetId, pipeline: "transcribe_enrich"}
    IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: Forward request

    IngestCtrl->>MediaRepo: Validate asset exists
    alt Asset not found
        MediaRepo-->>IngestCtrl: Not found
        IngestCtrl-->>User: 404 Asset Not Found
    end
    MediaRepo-->>IngestCtrl: Asset valid

    IngestCtrl->>JobRepo: Create IngestionJob<br/>{status: "queued", pipeline}
    JobRepo-->>IngestCtrl: Job created {jobId}

    IngestCtrl-->>User: 200 OK (async)<br/>{jobId}

    Note over Worker: Background worker picks up job

    Worker->>JobRepo: Update job<br/>{status: "running", startedAt}

    Worker->>StorageSvc: Retrieve media file
    StorageSvc->>S3: Get file by storageKey
    S3-->>StorageSvc: Media file
    StorageSvc-->>Worker: File data

    Worker->>TranscribeSvc: Process audio
    TranscribeSvc->>STTAPI: Batch transcription<br/>(with diarization)
    STTAPI-->>TranscribeSvc: Full transcript + speakers + timestamps

    Note over TranscribeSvc: Create Transcript stub in PostgreSQL<br/>(id, assetId, sessionId, language)<br/>Summary text for search/preview<br/>Metadata (duration, speaker count)

    TranscribeSvc->>TranscriptRepo: Create Transcript stub<br/>{id (CUID), text summary, metadata}
    TranscriptRepo-->>TranscribeSvc: Transcript stub created {transcriptId}

    Note over TranscribeSvc: Create EnrichedTranscript in MongoDB<br/>(same id as PostgreSQL stub)<br/>Full segments, speakers, timestamps

    TranscribeSvc->>DocStoreSvc: Create EnrichedTranscript<br/>{_id: transcriptId, segments[], speakers[]}
    DocStoreSvc-->>TranscribeSvc: Document created

    alt Pipeline includes enrichment
        Worker->>EnrichSvc: Process transcript

        Note over EnrichSvc: NER: Extract entities<br/>(companies, products, people)<br/>Topic modeling: Extract main themes<br/>Sentiment analysis: Score emotional tone

        EnrichSvc->>DocStoreSvc: Update EnrichedTranscript<br/>Add enrichment{summary, topics, sentiment, entities}
        DocStoreSvc-->>EnrichSvc: Enrichment saved

        EnrichSvc->>TranscriptRepo: Update stub metadata<br/>(entity count, topics)
    end

    Worker->>JobRepo: Update job<br/>{status: "completed", transcriptId, completedAt}

    alt Pipeline is "full"
        Worker->>IndexerSvc: Generate embeddings
        Note over IndexerSvc: Use sentence transformer<br/>for each segment
        IndexerSvc->>EmbeddingRepo: Store embeddings (pgvector)<br/>{namespace, refType, refId, vector}
        EmbeddingRepo-->>IndexerSvc: Embeddings indexed
    end

    Worker->>EventBus: Emit analytics.updated<br/>{transcriptId, jobId}